WEBVTT

1
00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:29.480
- Hey.
- Hey.

2
00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:33.567
- Hey.
- Hey.

3
00:01:35.736 --> 00:01:37.404
- Hey.
- Hey.

4
00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.217
Hmm?

5
00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:04.682
That's right. It is I, Tai Lung.

6
00:02:04.682 --> 00:02:05.975
It can't be.

7
00:02:06.934 --> 00:02:08.143
Tai Lung.

8
00:02:08.143 --> 00:02:10.896
I have returned to take what is mine.

9
00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:14.191
Which is everything that is yours.

10
00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:27.663
Let it be known from the highest mountain
to the lowest valley that Tai Lung lives,

11
00:02:27.663 --> 00:02:30.833
and no one will stand in his way.

12
00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:34.837
Not even the great Dragon Warrior.

13
00:02:43.887 --> 00:02:45.806
Oh, where is Po?

14
00:02:45.806 --> 00:02:48.559
He was supposed to be here hours ago.

15
00:02:48.559 --> 00:02:51.562
Ping, will you please just relax?

16
00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:53.522
I am relaxed!

17
00:02:53.522 --> 00:02:56.233
Okay. I'm sure Po is fine.

18
00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:58.819
But what if he's sick? What if he's hurt?

19
00:02:58.819 --> 00:03:00.446
- What if he's hungry?

20
00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:02.197
Don't get your noodles in a twist.

21
00:03:02.197 --> 00:03:06.744
If I know our son, he's probably just
kicking back and catching some rays.

22
00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:14.251
Kung fu!

23
00:03:15.336 --> 00:03:17.546
Whoa! That's bad.

24
00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:20.424
Whoa! Getting worse.

25
00:03:21.842 --> 00:03:22.843
Whoa!

26
00:03:22.843 --> 00:03:25.679
Ah, come on!

27
00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:44.865
Ha-ha!

28
00:03:49.453 --> 00:03:52.581
Okay, big guy.
We're really gonna have to wrap this up.

29
00:04:05.636 --> 00:04:06.679
Whee!

30
00:04:07.596 --> 00:04:09.181
- Oink.
- Oink.

31
00:04:09.181 --> 00:04:10.266
- Again, again!

32
00:04:10.266 --> 00:04:12.184
- That was fun.
- Let's do that again.

33
00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:17.021
And next time,
keep your surf off their turf.

34
00:04:22.403 --> 00:04:25.030
I'm late. I'm late. Ooh, I'm late.

35
00:04:26.115 --> 00:04:28.450
- The Dragon Warrior is back!
- It's the Dragon Warrior!

36
00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.078
Was, is and always will be.

37
00:04:31.078 --> 00:04:32.955
We love you, Dragon Warrior!

38
00:04:32.955 --> 00:04:34.582
And I love you too, adoring fan.

39
00:04:34.582 --> 00:04:36.166
- Sign my scroll.
- Sign my hat.

40
00:04:36.166 --> 00:04:37.334
- Sign my shirt.
- Okay, okay.

41
00:04:37.334 --> 00:04:38.752
I'll sign whatever you want.

42
00:04:39.587 --> 00:04:40.629
Po!

43
00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:42.756
Master Shifu!

44
00:04:42.756 --> 00:04:44.383
Here, let me just--

45
00:04:45.092 --> 00:04:47.845
There, that's much... worse.

46
00:04:49.138 --> 00:04:50.180
We have to talk.

47
00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.058
Absolutely. Let's talk.
Right after the ceremony.

48
00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:55.144
- Let's go!
- Ceremony?

49
00:04:55.144 --> 00:04:56.437
What ceremony?

50
00:04:57.062 --> 00:04:58.898
- The Staff of Wisdom.
- Ooh.

51
00:04:58.898 --> 00:05:01.692
- Given to me by Master Oogway himself.
- Aah.

52
00:05:01.692 --> 00:05:03.861
It is said that
whoever possesses this staff

53
00:05:03.861 --> 00:05:06.822
has the power
to travel between the realms.

54
00:05:06.822 --> 00:05:09.742
The power to unlock the door
to the Spirit Realm.

55
00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:12.161
And now, the power to open...

56
00:05:12.161 --> 00:05:16.957
the all-new
Dragon Warrior Noodles and Tofu.

57
00:05:18.709 --> 00:05:23.088
Where the broth has kick
and the bean curd's a knockout.

58
00:05:27.259 --> 00:05:28.594
Dragon Warrior!

59
00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.721
Will the Furious Five be here too?

60
00:05:30.721 --> 00:05:32.097
Unfortunately, no.

61
00:05:32.097 --> 00:05:34.767
They're off on
super cool kung fu missions.

62
00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:37.228
Tigress is taking on
the free-range chicken gang.

63
00:05:37.228 --> 00:05:39.438
Monkey's hot on the trail
of the missing macaque.

64
00:05:39.438 --> 00:05:41.273
Crane was crowned
king of the Crocodilians.

65
00:05:41.273 --> 00:05:42.650
- Crane!
- Long story.

66
00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.527
Viper's wrapping up peace talks
between the cobras and the mongooses.

67
00:05:45.527 --> 00:05:46.487
Or is it mongeese?

68
00:05:46.487 --> 00:05:47.780
And Mantis?

69
00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.824
Well, he's just trying to keep his
blushing bride from biting his head off.

70
00:05:53.035 --> 00:05:54.453
Just 'cause they're not here in person

71
00:05:54.453 --> 00:05:57.122
doesn't mean they're not here
as life-sized cut-outs.

72
00:05:57.122 --> 00:06:00.209
Now, who wants a picture?
Okay, okay. One at a time.

73
00:06:00.209 --> 00:06:02.002
- Oh! Me, me, me! Me!
- You.

74
00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.672
My turn! My turn!

75
00:06:04.672 --> 00:06:05.756
And then you.

76
00:06:11.512 --> 00:06:13.597
He really captured
your disapproving scowl.

77
00:06:13.597 --> 00:06:14.807
We need to talk.

78
00:06:15.849 --> 00:06:17.476
- Now.

79
00:06:17.476 --> 00:06:19.562
Hey, can I get one of those
in a wallet size?

80
00:06:19.562 --> 00:06:20.896
- Po!
- Coming.

81
00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:26.360
Do you remember the first time you climbed
these steps to the Jade Palace?

82
00:06:27.236 --> 00:06:30.155
How could I forget?
I thought I'd never make it to the top.

83
00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:31.657
Yes, but you persevered.

84
00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:35.911
And once again, destiny calls for you
to take the next step on your journey.

85
00:06:35.911 --> 00:06:37.830
The next step?
What are you talking about?

86
00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.207
I've already taken all the steps.
Haven't I?

87
00:06:40.207 --> 00:06:43.002
It is time for you
to choose your successor.

88
00:06:43.002 --> 00:06:44.420
Successor for what?

89
00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.840
A successor to be
the next Dragon Warrior.

90
00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.800
Oh... Yeah, I get it.

91
00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.219
Funny, 'cause I'm the Dragon Warrior.

92
00:06:55.598 --> 00:06:56.932
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait, wait.

93
00:06:56.932 --> 00:06:59.685
You mean, I'm not gonna be
the Dragon Warrior anymore?

94
00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:01.645
- Exactly.
- Then what am I gonna be?

95
00:07:01.645 --> 00:07:03.314
Once a successor is chosen,

96
00:07:03.314 --> 00:07:06.442
you will advance
to the highest level in all of kung fu.

97
00:07:06.442 --> 00:07:09.528
Spiritual Leader
of the Valley of Peace.

98
00:07:10.446 --> 00:07:11.906
Whoa.

99
00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.366
I don't know what that means.

100
00:07:14.366 --> 00:07:16.785
It's just like
Master Oogway before you.

101
00:07:16.785 --> 00:07:21.415
You will oversee the Valley,
passing along wisdom and inspiring hope.

102
00:07:21.415 --> 00:07:23.667
Look, I appreciate the promotion.

103
00:07:23.667 --> 00:07:27.296
I think I'm just gonna stick with
the whole "Dragon Warrior" thing.

104
00:07:27.296 --> 00:07:30.215
Dragon Warrior "thing"?
What is it you're holding?

105
00:07:30.215 --> 00:07:31.383
A cookie.

106
00:07:31.383 --> 00:07:32.676
Other hand.

107
00:07:32.676 --> 00:07:34.386
The Staff of Wisdom.

108
00:07:34.386 --> 00:07:36.388
It was given to you
by Master Oogway.

109
00:07:36.388 --> 00:07:38.724
Do you really think it was so you could
open a restaurant?

110
00:07:38.724 --> 00:07:39.975
Or pose for pictures?

111
00:07:39.975 --> 00:07:41.727
He wasn't super specific.

112
00:07:41.727 --> 00:07:46.023
Oogway entrusted you with that staff
so you could follow in his footsteps

113
00:07:46.023 --> 00:07:48.984
and become something better
than you already are.

114
00:07:48.984 --> 00:07:50.236
You take it.

115
00:07:50.819 --> 00:07:52.863
No. Oogway did not give it to me.

116
00:07:52.863 --> 00:07:56.325
Being the next Oogway is not my destiny,
which I have accepted

117
00:07:56.325 --> 00:07:57.618
and am at peace with.

118
00:07:57.618 --> 00:07:59.662
- Really. It's fine.
- You don't sound fine.

119
00:07:59.662 --> 00:08:02.289
- You don't sound fine! I'm very fine!
- Okay, you're fine.

120
00:08:02.289 --> 00:08:03.457
This is an honor.

121
00:08:03.457 --> 00:08:07.586
Oogway chose you as his successor,
and now you must choose yours.

122
00:08:07.586 --> 00:08:10.381
Master Shifu,
I finally found something I'm good at,

123
00:08:10.381 --> 00:08:12.174
and now you want to
just take it away from me?

124
00:08:12.174 --> 00:08:14.343
No one is taking anything away, Po.

125
00:08:14.343 --> 00:08:16.887
Who you are will always be
a part of what you become.

126
00:08:16.887 --> 00:08:19.640
Yeah, but where's the "skadoosh"?
You know what I mean?

127
00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.392
The "shasha-booie"?

128
00:08:21.392 --> 00:08:22.893
I don't want to seem ungrateful,

129
00:08:22.893 --> 00:08:25.563
but I don't know anything
about passing on wisdom or inspiring hope.

130
00:08:25.563 --> 00:08:27.606
All I know are two things.

131
00:08:27.606 --> 00:08:30.943
Kicking butt and taking names.

132
00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:34.029
And if I'm being completely honest,
I'm not even that good at the name-taking.

133
00:08:34.029 --> 00:08:36.197
Like, who was
that fire-breathing crocodile?

134
00:08:36.197 --> 00:08:37.700
I wanna say Steve...

135
00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.034
You were chosen
to bring peace to the Valley,

136
00:08:40.034 --> 00:08:44.373
and there are other ways to bring peace
than simply kicking butt.

137
00:08:44.373 --> 00:08:46.542
Well, sure. But not any fun ones.

138
00:08:46.542 --> 00:08:49.878
Please. Being the Dragon Warrior
is all I know.

139
00:08:49.878 --> 00:08:52.047
- It's who I am.
- Not anymore.

140
00:08:52.047 --> 00:08:54.216
The Valley of Peace needs
a Spiritual Leader,

141
00:08:54.216 --> 00:08:56.093
and Master Oogway chose you.

142
00:08:56.093 --> 00:08:59.054
You'll start interviewing candidates
first thing tomorrow morning.

143
00:08:59.054 --> 00:09:01.557
Candidates? What candidates?

144
00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:13.777
Awesome!

145
00:09:21.076 --> 00:09:22.202
No way!

146
00:09:25.664 --> 00:09:26.874
Wow!

147
00:09:27.499 --> 00:09:28.918
Skadoosh.

148
00:09:28.918 --> 00:09:30.336
Fantastic pose.

149
00:09:40.721 --> 00:09:42.723
Whoo-hoo! Nice.

150
00:09:44.058 --> 00:09:49.230
Master Po will now choose
the next Dragon Warrior.

151
00:09:51.148 --> 00:09:54.109
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!

152
00:09:54.109 --> 00:09:58.113
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!

153
00:09:58.906 --> 00:10:00.241
So many great candidates.

154
00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.244
I'm gonna let the finger decide.

155
00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:06.413
Wait. Whoa. Whoa.

156
00:10:06.413 --> 00:10:08.290
What is happening?

157
00:10:08.999 --> 00:10:11.627
The Dragon Warrior. It's me!

158
00:10:17.424 --> 00:10:20.177
Like it or not, Po,
you have to choose a successor.

159
00:10:20.177 --> 00:10:24.139
Eh. Nothing about them
says "dragon" or "warrior."

160
00:10:24.139 --> 00:10:25.849
You will know when you know.

161
00:10:25.849 --> 00:10:28.644
How do I know when I know?
You know?

162
00:10:29.687 --> 00:10:33.107
When I'm conflicted, I come here
to ask the universe for answers.

163
00:10:33.691 --> 00:10:35.359
Just as Oogway did before me.

164
00:10:35.359 --> 00:10:38.404
I'm not conflicted.
I'm just not ready for a next step.

165
00:10:38.404 --> 00:10:39.613
What is that you're holding?

166
00:10:39.613 --> 00:10:41.073
The Staff of Wisdom?

167
00:10:41.073 --> 00:10:42.157
Other hand.

168
00:10:42.157 --> 00:10:43.742
A chewed-up peach pit?

169
00:10:43.742 --> 00:10:45.202
Exactly.

170
00:10:45.202 --> 00:10:49.582
Every pit holds the promise
of a mighty tree.

171
00:10:49.582 --> 00:10:51.834
Uh, how is this gonna help me
find the answers?

172
00:10:51.834 --> 00:10:55.004
Don't ask me. Ask the universe.

173
00:10:55.004 --> 00:10:57.673
Be the pit, Po. Be the pit.

174
00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:02.011
There we go.

175
00:11:02.011 --> 00:11:03.637
All right, universe.

176
00:11:04.763 --> 00:11:06.307
Give me some guidance.

177
00:11:08.017 --> 00:11:09.518
Inner peace.

178
00:11:10.394 --> 00:11:11.770
Inner peace.

179
00:11:12.396 --> 00:11:13.814
Inner peace.

180
00:11:14.315 --> 00:11:15.649
Dinner, please.

181
00:11:16.233 --> 00:11:17.693
Dinner with peas.

182
00:11:18.527 --> 00:11:19.862
Snow peas?

183
00:11:19.862 --> 00:11:22.114
In a sesame soy glaze.

184
00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.533
Inner peace.

185
00:11:25.242 --> 00:11:26.410
Inner peace.

186
00:11:28.746 --> 00:11:30.581
This is not working at all.

187
00:11:30.581 --> 00:11:32.249
Maybe focus on your breathing?

188
00:11:32.249 --> 00:11:35.002
I'm trying, but it's kinda hard
when you keep talking to me.

189
00:11:35.002 --> 00:11:37.838
Technically, you're talking to you,
if you think about it.

190
00:11:37.838 --> 00:11:40.591
Hey, will you two be quiet?
I'm trying to concentrate here.

191
00:11:40.591 --> 00:11:42.927
Wait, if I'm Po's inner voice,
then who are you?

192
00:11:42.927 --> 00:11:44.970
Uh, I'm Po's inner, inner voice.

193
00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.555
How many voices do I have in there?

194
00:11:46.555 --> 00:11:48.724
- You do not want to know.
- This dirt is itchy.

195
00:11:48.724 --> 00:11:50.392
- I just love kung fu.
- What am I gonna be?

196
00:11:50.392 --> 00:11:53.229
- Are we alone in the universe?
- You guys thought it was awesome, right?

197
00:11:55.898 --> 00:11:57.316
Anyone want a cookie?

198
00:12:03.781 --> 00:12:04.782
Universe?

199
00:12:07.326 --> 00:12:08.327
Is that you?

200
00:12:26.136 --> 00:12:28.180
Attention, mysterious figure!

201
00:12:28.764 --> 00:12:32.476
The Dragon Warrior's here
to perform justice.

202
00:12:36.105 --> 00:12:38.232
I know you're in here.

203
00:12:38.232 --> 00:12:40.859
Just a matter of time before I find you.

204
00:12:42.486 --> 00:12:43.487
Ooh.

205
00:12:52.288 --> 00:12:54.582
You can't hide from justice forever.

206
00:12:59.795 --> 00:13:02.089
The Dagger of Deng Wa.

207
00:13:02.089 --> 00:13:04.049
You've got excellent taste,
I'll give you that.

208
00:13:04.758 --> 00:13:06.385
But I can't give you that.
Give it back.

209
00:13:06.385 --> 00:13:08.137
If you insist.

210
00:13:19.315 --> 00:13:21.275
- Oh, no!

211
00:13:21.275 --> 00:13:24.570
He's got a walking stick.
What are you gonna do? Stroll me to death?

212
00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:28.198
This stick is not for the strolling.
It's the Staff of Wisdom.

213
00:13:28.198 --> 00:13:30.868
The Dragon Warrior is gonna be mad
when he finds out you took his stick.

214
00:13:30.868 --> 00:13:32.786
I am the Dragon Warrior.

215
00:13:33.913 --> 00:13:37.249
I'm just gonna say it. Nothing about you
says "dragon" or "warrior."

216
00:13:46.967 --> 00:13:49.428
Whoa.

217
00:13:50.638 --> 00:13:52.056
Hi-yah!

218
00:13:53.015 --> 00:13:56.185
How dare you desecrate the Hall of Heroes?

219
00:13:56.185 --> 00:13:57.728
Who's desecrating what now?

220
00:13:57.728 --> 00:13:59.521
Master Ostrich's Egg!

221
00:13:59.521 --> 00:14:02.233
Oops, my bad. Hi-yah!

222
00:14:02.233 --> 00:14:04.610
The Indestructible Chain Hammer
of Master Pangolin.

223
00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.861
Whoopsies.

224
00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.367
Ha-ha! Oh!

225
00:14:18.165 --> 00:14:20.084
The Urn of Whispering Warriors!

226
00:14:20.084 --> 00:14:22.628
Which I've already broken! Twice!

227
00:14:23.879 --> 00:14:26.799
Why would you keep an urn of souls?
Feels kinda creepy.

228
00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.638
Are you doing okay there, big guy?
You're looking a little tired.

229
00:14:32.638 --> 00:14:34.515
- I've never felt more awake!

230
00:14:37.309 --> 00:14:39.061
The War Hammer of Master Chipmunk?

231
00:14:42.648 --> 00:14:43.983
You're gonna pay for that.

232
00:14:47.653 --> 00:14:48.612
Hello?

233
00:14:59.498 --> 00:15:00.666
You faker.

234
00:15:00.666 --> 00:15:02.751
It's not faking. It's called Method.

235
00:15:03.252 --> 00:15:05.045
Catch ya later, panda.

236
00:15:05.754 --> 00:15:06.880
No.

237
00:15:13.345 --> 00:15:15.097
I think I'll catch you now.

238
00:15:20.811 --> 00:15:21.896
Whoa!

239
00:15:28.652 --> 00:15:29.737
Whoa!

240
00:15:31.113 --> 00:15:32.156
Whoa!

241
00:15:35.784 --> 00:15:36.744
Told ya.

242
00:15:36.744 --> 00:15:39.872
You got me,
oh-great-and-powerful Dumpling Warrior.

243
00:15:39.872 --> 00:15:41.832
That's Dragon Warrior--

244
00:15:42.875 --> 00:15:44.376
Let go of me.

245
00:15:44.376 --> 00:15:45.711
Just tell me one thing.

246
00:15:45.711 --> 00:15:48.130
How did someone like you
become the Dragon Warrior?

247
00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.424
That's a mystery for you to solve
during your two-year stay

248
00:15:50.424 --> 00:15:51.842
at the Valley of Peace prison.

249
00:15:51.842 --> 00:15:54.803
Valley of Peace prison?
Sounds like a day care.

250
00:15:54.803 --> 00:15:56.555
It is a day care on the weekends.

251
00:15:57.139 --> 00:15:58.766
But it's also a prison.

252
00:15:58.766 --> 00:15:59.975
There he is!

253
00:15:59.975 --> 00:16:01.018
Dragon Warrior!

254
00:16:01.018 --> 00:16:03.020
- Tai Lung is back.
- Tai Lung has returned?

255
00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:06.190
He demanded all of our iron,
then destroyed our quarry.

256
00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.776
- He's supposed to be in the Spirit Realm.
- Well, he's back.

257
00:16:08.776 --> 00:16:11.654
He said that he's not gonna stop
until the Valley of Peace falls

258
00:16:11.654 --> 00:16:13.989
and the Dragon Warrior
bows before him.

259
00:16:13.989 --> 00:16:16.158
- He's back.
- Please, you've got to do something.

260
00:16:16.867 --> 00:16:20.204
Looks like I'm not the only one
around here with a mystery to solve.

261
00:16:20.204 --> 00:16:22.206
Well, you know what they say...

262
00:16:22.206 --> 00:16:27.044
every step leaves a footprint,
no matter how small.

263
00:16:46.313 --> 00:16:51.235
Every step leaves a footprint,
no matter how small.

264
00:16:56.323 --> 00:16:58.659
Very clever, fox. You know something.

265
00:16:58.659 --> 00:17:00.828
Maybe I do, maybe I don't.

266
00:17:01.328 --> 00:17:03.205
Okay, I do. I really, really do.

267
00:17:03.205 --> 00:17:04.873
- Tell me.
- And why should I?

268
00:17:04.873 --> 00:17:06.083
I mean, what's in it for me?

269
00:17:06.083 --> 00:17:08.168
The peace of mind
knowing you did the right thing.

270
00:17:08.168 --> 00:17:10.713
You're adorable.
Has anyone ever told you that?

271
00:17:10.713 --> 00:17:12.506
And I don't mean just in, like,
the cuddly sense.

272
00:17:12.506 --> 00:17:13.799
I don't have time for games.

273
00:17:13.799 --> 00:17:15.968
Tai Lung is running loose
in the Valley of Peace.

274
00:17:15.968 --> 00:17:20.139
Maybe. Or maybe she wants you to think
it was Tai Lung.

275
00:17:20.139 --> 00:17:21.390
Wait. She?

276
00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.683
Mine!

277
00:17:23.517 --> 00:17:26.729
The Empress of Disguise,
capable of taking any form,

278
00:17:26.729 --> 00:17:28.021
mimicking any shape.

279
00:17:28.021 --> 00:17:29.148
The master of deception.

280
00:17:29.148 --> 00:17:31.525
The lizard of lies
with the glowing teal eyes.

281
00:17:31.525 --> 00:17:32.735
I'm talking 'bout...

282
00:17:33.444 --> 00:17:35.487
The Chameleon.

283
00:17:37.531 --> 00:17:39.742
This is kind of a private conversation.

284
00:17:40.951 --> 00:17:42.494
Who's The Chameleon?

285
00:17:42.494 --> 00:17:44.872
Only the most powerful
shape-shifting sorceress.

286
00:17:44.872 --> 00:17:47.333
So she shape-shifted into Tai Lung.

287
00:17:47.833 --> 00:17:50.002
But what does she have against me
and the Valley of Peace?

288
00:17:50.002 --> 00:17:52.171
These are good questions.
You should ask her.

289
00:17:52.171 --> 00:17:56.091
You're right.
How do I find this "The Chameleon"?

290
00:17:56.091 --> 00:17:57.760
She isn't someone who can be found.

291
00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.554
At least not without someone in the know.

292
00:18:00.554 --> 00:18:03.432
And how do I find someone "in the know"?

293
00:18:03.432 --> 00:18:06.518
Oh! It's me.
It's obviously-- It's me.

294
00:18:06.518 --> 00:18:07.811
I'm in the know.

295
00:18:07.811 --> 00:18:10.356
Forget it. I'll find her on my own.

296
00:18:10.981 --> 00:18:11.982
Good luck.

297
00:18:11.982 --> 00:18:15.152
After all, how hard can it be
to find someone who can look like anyone,

298
00:18:15.152 --> 00:18:16.445
blend in anywhere?

299
00:18:20.074 --> 00:18:22.409
Fine. You lead me to The Chameleon,

300
00:18:22.409 --> 00:18:24.787
and I'll see what I can do
about reducing your sentence.

301
00:18:24.787 --> 00:18:26.080
Deal.

302
00:18:27.164 --> 00:18:28.290
- Po!

303
00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.583
What do you think you're doing?

304
00:18:29.583 --> 00:18:33.045
There's this shape-shifting
sorceress on the loose and--

305
00:18:33.045 --> 00:18:35.130
That's a job for the Furious Five.

306
00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.175
Well, they're not here, and someone
needs to protect the Valley of Peace.

307
00:18:38.175 --> 00:18:40.052
Look, I know that change is difficult

308
00:18:40.052 --> 00:18:42.596
and that you enjoy
being the Dragon Warrior,

309
00:18:42.596 --> 00:18:45.057
but your job is finding a successor.

310
00:18:45.057 --> 00:18:48.519
The Dragon Warrior and I have a deal.
Mind your own business, squirrel.

311
00:18:48.519 --> 00:18:50.229
Master Shifu is not a squirrel.

312
00:18:50.229 --> 00:18:51.480
I'm a red panda.

313
00:18:52.856 --> 00:18:54.608
You know what? I love that for you.

314
00:18:54.608 --> 00:18:56.235
Po, this is your decision.

315
00:18:56.235 --> 00:19:00.698
But I think you know what choice
Master Oogway would want you to make.

316
00:19:05.619 --> 00:19:07.454
- Thanks for the free stay.
- What are you doing?

317
00:19:07.454 --> 00:19:08.872
- Little dank for a day care.
- Wait!

318
00:19:08.872 --> 00:19:10.416
- Not bad for a jail.
- Where is she going?

319
00:19:10.416 --> 00:19:11.500
You can't leave.

320
00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.753
Don't worry, I'll have her back
before you even know she was gone.

321
00:19:14.753 --> 00:19:17.965
You are supposed to be
passing along wisdom and inspiring hope!

322
00:19:17.965 --> 00:19:20.718
Just think of it as
one last Dragon Warrior adventure.

323
00:19:20.718 --> 00:19:23.095
I'll be back soon.
Tell my dads I love 'em.

324
00:19:23.095 --> 00:19:25.431
- I can't hear you anymore! Bye!

325
00:19:28.142 --> 00:19:31.478
Yeah! It sure is good
to be a free fox again.

326
00:19:31.478 --> 00:19:33.147
That's a good back scratcher.

327
00:19:33.147 --> 00:19:34.481
- Yoink!
- Hey!

328
00:19:34.481 --> 00:19:36.734
So, does this really unlock the door
to the Spirit Realm?

329
00:19:36.734 --> 00:19:38.360
It doesn't work like that.

330
00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.155
It has to be given
in order to gain its powers.

331
00:19:41.155 --> 00:19:44.116
Gotcha. Given to gain.
So, can I have it?

332
00:19:44.116 --> 00:19:45.868
No! What do you take me for?

333
00:19:45.868 --> 00:19:46.952
An easy mark.

334
00:19:46.952 --> 00:19:48.037
What's an easy mark?

335
00:19:48.037 --> 00:19:49.705
Someone who's easy to steal from,

336
00:19:49.705 --> 00:19:51.916
usually because they're generous
and too trusting.

337
00:19:51.916 --> 00:19:54.084
- Like you.
- Aw, thank you.

338
00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.799
I heard The Chameleon is a monster
with an appetite of a thousand predators,

339
00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:02.927
and her favorite food is panda.

340
00:20:02.927 --> 00:20:06.722
They say this Chameleon character
has magical powers.

341
00:20:06.722 --> 00:20:10.476
If you say her name three times,
she'll take you away in the night!

342
00:20:12.019 --> 00:20:15.940
The Chameleon can shape-shift
to look like anyone, even you.

343
00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.441
Or you.

344
00:20:20.778 --> 00:20:23.030
Mr. Li! Mr. Li! Is it true?

345
00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.824
Po's going to
take down an evil sorceress?

346
00:20:25.824 --> 00:20:27.785
The-- The Chameleon?

347
00:20:27.785 --> 00:20:31.121
Well, a Dragon Warrior's work
is never done.

348
00:20:31.121 --> 00:20:34.375
Li, I'm thinking Po teaming up
with a convicted felon

349
00:20:34.375 --> 00:20:38.254
to take down an evil sorceress
wasn't such a great idea.

350
00:20:38.254 --> 00:20:43.217
Relax. Po has faced demons, demigods,
and everything else in between.

351
00:20:43.217 --> 00:20:44.426
He's always come out on top.

352
00:20:44.426 --> 00:20:46.637
You're right. You're right.

353
00:20:46.637 --> 00:20:48.514
But what if you're wrong?

354
00:20:48.514 --> 00:20:50.266
Calm down, Ping.

355
00:20:50.266 --> 00:20:53.269
How bad can one evil sorceress be?

356
00:20:55.229 --> 00:20:57.690
Who is she to summon us?

357
00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:58.941
Classic power move.

358
00:20:58.941 --> 00:21:02.319
We're the heads of Juniper City's
most prominent crime families.

359
00:21:02.319 --> 00:21:05.948
And she's just some bug-eyed,
power-hungry reptilian runt.

360
00:21:05.948 --> 00:21:07.658
You left out the evil sorceress part.

361
00:21:07.658 --> 00:21:09.535
We used to run this city.

362
00:21:09.535 --> 00:21:12.121
Now we pay her half the money we swindle.

363
00:21:12.121 --> 00:21:14.707
It's like a criminal can't
make an honest living anymore.

364
00:21:14.707 --> 00:21:16.208
Yeah, but what could we do?

365
00:21:17.126 --> 00:21:19.420
Together, we can take her down.

366
00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:22.339
- Are you nuts? She's a shape-shifter.

367
00:21:22.339 --> 00:21:26.343
She could be at this very table,
and we'd have no idea.

368
00:21:27.886 --> 00:21:30.222
For all we know,
you're The Chameleon.

369
00:21:30.222 --> 00:21:32.141
Or you're The Chameleon.

370
00:21:32.141 --> 00:21:33.893
- Or maybe...
- Oh, no.

371
00:21:33.893 --> 00:21:35.269
- Maybe...
- Don't say it.

372
00:21:35.895 --> 00:21:37.563
...I'm The Chameleon.

373
00:21:37.563 --> 00:21:38.772
I said don't say it.

374
00:21:46.363 --> 00:21:48.198
We obviously spoke out of turn.

375
00:21:48.198 --> 00:21:49.283
Sorry, Chameleon.

376
00:21:49.283 --> 00:21:51.160
No, no. Don't apologize.

377
00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:55.664
You and your families prospered
by preying upon the weak,

378
00:21:55.664 --> 00:21:59.418
so it doesn't feel good
when you're the one being squeezed.

379
00:21:59.418 --> 00:22:02.087
Especially when the one
doing the squeezing

380
00:22:02.087 --> 00:22:05.591
is just a "bug-eyed, power-hungry"...

381
00:22:05.591 --> 00:22:07.176
What was the rest?

382
00:22:07.176 --> 00:22:09.094
Reptilian runt.

383
00:22:09.094 --> 00:22:13.265
Well, this "reptilian runt" wants more.

384
00:22:13.265 --> 00:22:15.309
You already have the city.

385
00:22:15.309 --> 00:22:17.269
What else could you possibly want?

386
00:22:17.269 --> 00:22:21.357
I have something special in mind.
I'm very close to achieving it.

387
00:22:21.357 --> 00:22:24.151
As close as the blood moon.

388
00:22:24.151 --> 00:22:25.819
But the blood moon
is two nights away.

389
00:22:25.819 --> 00:22:28.447
So little time, so many expenses.

390
00:22:28.447 --> 00:22:33.869
Which is why I'll need to increase
this month's tribute to 60%.

391
00:22:33.869 --> 00:22:34.995
No.

392
00:22:39.917 --> 00:22:41.377
What was that now?

393
00:22:41.961 --> 00:22:44.463
I mean no disrespect.

394
00:22:46.215 --> 00:22:47.758
Don't worry.

395
00:22:47.758 --> 00:22:53.722
I forgive you for the impudence
and the backstabbing.

396
00:22:53.722 --> 00:22:59.144
And the blatant disrespect
you've shown me, I forgive.

397
00:22:59.728 --> 00:23:02.022
But I never forget.

398
00:23:02.022 --> 00:23:04.316
You might say I have the memory...

399
00:23:04.316 --> 00:23:05.526
Oh, don't say it.

400
00:23:05.526 --> 00:23:07.653
...of an elephant.

401
00:23:23.419 --> 00:23:26.672
You think
I've pushed you too far?

402
00:23:26.672 --> 00:23:30.843
Then you, my friend, can't begin to fathom

403
00:23:30.843 --> 00:23:34.680
just how far I can push.

404
00:23:40.686 --> 00:23:43.772
I'll expect your tributes by dawn.

405
00:23:47.568 --> 00:23:49.737
Are we gonna stop
for lunch soon?

406
00:23:49.737 --> 00:23:51.822
Justice doesn't stop for lunch.

407
00:23:51.822 --> 00:23:54.700
But it does take the occasional time-out
for snackage.

408
00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.493
Wanna split my almond cookie?

409
00:23:56.493 --> 00:24:00.080
You're just gonna give me half of your
cookie out of the goodness of your heart?

410
00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.458
- Mm-hmm.
- What's the catch? The rub? The bamboozle?

411
00:24:02.458 --> 00:24:03.417
The "bam-what-le"?

412
00:24:03.417 --> 00:24:05.461
You know, the fleece.
The rook. The flimflam.

413
00:24:05.461 --> 00:24:07.046
Do you want the cookie or not?

414
00:24:10.925 --> 00:24:12.509
I got my eye on you.

415
00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:17.014
How much farther is it
to this "The Chameleon"?

416
00:24:17.014 --> 00:24:18.223
Just a little farther.

417
00:24:33.113 --> 00:24:36.659
Li! What are you doing out here
in the middle of the night?

418
00:24:36.659 --> 00:24:40.329
Well, I-- I-- I... didn't wanna miss
the blood moon rising.

419
00:24:40.329 --> 00:24:43.082
Oh, pooh.
You are just as worried as I am.

420
00:24:43.082 --> 00:24:44.500
All right, all right.

421
00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:47.336
I know pandas come across as
calm, gentle and chill,

422
00:24:47.336 --> 00:24:49.672
but... ...the truth is

423
00:24:49.672 --> 00:24:51.257
I'm kinda freaking out!

424
00:24:51.257 --> 00:24:52.299
So am I.

425
00:24:52.299 --> 00:24:56.595
Po is just too calm, gentle and chill
to face a shape-shifting sorceress.

426
00:24:56.595 --> 00:24:59.473
- What if he's captured?
- What if he's tortured?

427
00:24:59.473 --> 00:25:01.392
Our baby!

428
00:25:02.518 --> 00:25:03.978
Okay, okay.

429
00:25:03.978 --> 00:25:06.230
Maybe Po has finally met his match,

430
00:25:06.230 --> 00:25:10.192
but there is still something that he has
that The Chameleon does not.

431
00:25:10.192 --> 00:25:12.319
- What's that?
- Us.

432
00:25:12.319 --> 00:25:15.239
Now, let's go find our son.

433
00:25:15.239 --> 00:25:16.448
I hope Po's okay.

434
00:25:16.448 --> 00:25:19.493
You know, Li,
a wise goose once said,

435
00:25:19.493 --> 00:25:22.538
"Worrying doesn't make
the broth boil any faster."

436
00:25:22.538 --> 00:25:25.040
- Who was that idiot?
- Me, of course.

437
00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:26.584
I was the wise goose.

438
00:25:26.584 --> 00:25:28.335
Oh, yeah.

439
00:25:28.335 --> 00:25:30.254
Whoa.

440
00:25:30.254 --> 00:25:32.298
That's the biggest village I've ever seen.

441
00:25:32.298 --> 00:25:34.091
That's no village.

442
00:25:34.091 --> 00:25:36.051
That's Juniper City.

443
00:25:36.051 --> 00:25:37.886
That's where I'll find
The Chameleon, huh?

444
00:25:37.886 --> 00:25:39.430
Just a boat ride away.

445
00:25:39.430 --> 00:25:42.016
And I'm gonna lead you
right to her front door.

446
00:25:42.016 --> 00:25:43.976
Are you sure we'll find
a boat captain in there?

447
00:25:43.976 --> 00:25:46.854
For the right price, those cutthroats will
take us anywhere we want to go.

448
00:25:47.438 --> 00:25:50.566
Of course, we could always opt for
the four-finger discount.

449
00:25:50.566 --> 00:25:51.859
No stealing.

450
00:25:52.735 --> 00:25:54.361
"The Happy Bunny Tavern".

451
00:25:54.361 --> 00:25:56.238
Well, that sounds inviting.

452
00:26:01.243 --> 00:26:03.162
Anybody lose a rabbit?

453
00:26:09.376 --> 00:26:10.669
Stir faster!

454
00:26:13.005 --> 00:26:16.175
Welcome to the Happy Bunny Tavern.

455
00:26:16.175 --> 00:26:19.011
I'll find us a ride.
Maybe you can get us some food.

456
00:26:19.553 --> 00:26:20.971
And stay out of trouble.

457
00:26:23.182 --> 00:26:24.600
Hey, what you guys playing?

458
00:26:24.600 --> 00:26:26.352
Mah-jongg.

459
00:26:26.352 --> 00:26:28.020
And the stakes are high.

460
00:26:28.020 --> 00:26:29.104
Can I play?

461
00:26:29.104 --> 00:26:32.524
Surely you'll go easy on a beginner,
'cause I'm very beginning.

462
00:26:34.193 --> 00:26:36.403
- Hey there.
- What can I get you?

463
00:26:36.403 --> 00:26:38.280
A boat ride to Juniper City.

464
00:26:38.280 --> 00:26:39.365
Ask this guy.

465
00:26:41.909 --> 00:26:43.911
- Who's he?
- He's the captain.

466
00:26:43.911 --> 00:26:45.454
- Thanks.

467
00:26:48.582 --> 00:26:51.377
Oh, I win again.
Beginner's luck, I guess.

468
00:26:51.377 --> 00:26:53.254
Never played before, huh?

469
00:26:53.254 --> 00:26:55.256
I'm sorry, are you accusing me
of cheating?

470
00:26:55.256 --> 00:26:57.549
I would like to speak
to the manager, please.

471
00:26:57.549 --> 00:26:59.551
I am the manager.

472
00:27:00.094 --> 00:27:04.265
I'll give you a boat ride to Juniper City,
but I won't carry anything illegal.

473
00:27:04.265 --> 00:27:05.641
I don't want any trouble.

474
00:27:05.641 --> 00:27:07.601
Trouble runs from me.

475
00:27:07.601 --> 00:27:09.061
Then it'll cost you double.

476
00:27:09.061 --> 00:27:11.605
I'm confused.
Should I have said that I like trouble?

477
00:27:11.605 --> 00:27:13.440
In that case, it'll cost you triple.

478
00:27:13.440 --> 00:27:16.110
Oh. Uh, maybe we can go back
to the double price?

479
00:27:19.113 --> 00:27:20.531
You got a deal.

480
00:27:20.531 --> 00:27:23.492
Great.
Do I shake his hand or your hand?

481
00:27:24.410 --> 00:27:25.911
Can I get anything else for you, ma'am?

482
00:27:25.911 --> 00:27:27.371
Yes. Everything, again.

483
00:27:27.371 --> 00:27:29.415
Except for the broth. It was very bland.

484
00:27:29.415 --> 00:27:31.000
- Keep stirring!

485
00:27:32.501 --> 00:27:35.170
Whoa! One of everything is my go-to order.

486
00:27:35.963 --> 00:27:37.214
But how did you pay for this?

487
00:27:37.214 --> 00:27:39.174
Legally. Lawfully. Fair and square.

488
00:27:39.174 --> 00:27:40.634
- I'm proud of you.

489
00:27:51.645 --> 00:27:52.730
Oh, wow! Look at the time.

490
00:27:52.730 --> 00:27:55.649
Remember we have to do that thing
down by the place with that guy?

491
00:27:55.649 --> 00:28:00.154
Did you actually think you could
grift a meal out of me?

492
00:28:00.154 --> 00:28:03.198
There's gotta be some sort
of misunderstanding here.

493
00:28:05.159 --> 00:28:07.620
And apparently,
I'm the one misunderstanding.

494
00:28:07.620 --> 00:28:10.748
Please allow us to pay for our meal
and yours too.

495
00:28:10.748 --> 00:28:12.750
I'm only hungry for...

496
00:28:12.750 --> 00:28:14.209
- Dumplings?
- ...vengeance!

497
00:28:14.209 --> 00:28:16.170
Well, then, come and get it.

498
00:28:16.170 --> 00:28:18.172
No! No, no, no! Don't come and get it!

499
00:28:18.172 --> 00:28:20.215
- Destroy them!

500
00:28:32.895 --> 00:28:33.938
I got it!

501
00:28:44.323 --> 00:28:45.449
There you go.

502
00:28:47.326 --> 00:28:48.869
- All better.

503
00:28:48.869 --> 00:28:51.622
- Come on! Gotcha.

504
00:28:51.622 --> 00:28:52.873
Keep stirring!

505
00:29:01.340 --> 00:29:02.758
Oh, yeah!

506
00:29:21.777 --> 00:29:23.028
I'll take that.

507
00:29:26.115 --> 00:29:27.408
Think this belongs to you.

508
00:29:40.379 --> 00:29:41.880
No stealing!

509
00:29:46.427 --> 00:29:49.138
Yeah, I think it's
a little too late for that.

510
00:29:49.138 --> 00:29:51.432
It's never too late to do the right thing.

511
00:29:51.432 --> 00:29:53.058
- Get them!

512
00:29:53.058 --> 00:29:54.810
- Watch out!
- Whoa!

513
00:30:02.151 --> 00:30:04.028
- Skadoosh!

514
00:30:10.534 --> 00:30:14.246
- Whoa. Nice move. You gotta teach me that.

515
00:30:14.246 --> 00:30:16.373
You die, panda!

516
00:30:29.637 --> 00:30:30.846
Ah! Uh.

517
00:30:31.388 --> 00:30:33.349
Ah! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

518
00:30:35.309 --> 00:30:37.436
Who designs a tavern on a cliff?

519
00:30:37.436 --> 00:30:40.147
I shouldn't have eaten
all those dumplings.

520
00:30:41.190 --> 00:30:42.733
- Huh?

521
00:30:42.733 --> 00:30:43.984
Uh-oh.

522
00:30:48.656 --> 00:30:49.949
Sail ho!
